lass=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O9M5uSZNLGk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O9M5uSZNLGk</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid300\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid301\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">1993</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid302\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Hermetic<br />\n</span><span class=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jNRut2htTGA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jNRut2htTGA</a></span><span class=\"author-p-75962\">  </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid303\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid304\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-85837\">C64 Game &#8211; Complex (CP Verlag/Game On)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid305\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-85837 url\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lGXpuxd-cHE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lGXpuxd-cHE</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid306\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-85837\">Star Control 2 &#8211; Supermelee </span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-85837 url\"><a href=\"http://www.mobygames.com/game/star-control-ii\">http://www.mobygames.com/game/star-control-ii</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-85837\">remake </span><span class=\"author-p-85837 url\"><a href=\"http://sc2.sourceforge.net/\">http://sc2.sourceforge.net/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"