pan class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://whatson.ae/dubai/2016/06/pictures-hub-zero-gamers-dream-city-walk/\">http://whatson.ae/dubai/2016/06/pictures-hub-zero-gamers-dream-city-walk/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid413\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid414\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Foxn Forest (tip von teut weidemann)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid415\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/foxnforests/fox-n-forests\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/foxnforests/fox-n-forests</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid416\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid417\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid418\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid419\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">1000 amiga klassiker im netz</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid420\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://derstandard.at/2000042529961/Ueber-10-000-Klassiker-gratis-Internet-Archive-veroeffentlicht-Amiga-Programme\">http://derstandard.at/2000042529961/Ueber-10-000-Klassiker-gratis-Internet-Archive-veroeffentlicht-Amiga-Programme</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid421\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">laufen im browser!</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid422\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-85466\">After a beta-testing period, the emulated Amiga programs at the Archive have been taken down for further development.</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid423\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid424\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid425\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid426\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-03/amiga-ocs-spiel-the-great-giana-sisters-2016-se-earok/\">http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-03/amiga-ocs-spiel-the-great-giana-sisters-2016-se-earok/</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid427\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Amiga OCS Giana &#8222;Hack&#8220;</span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid431\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">c64v aufgemotzt (tip von christian)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid432\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vb1BGlAYdsE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vb1BGlAYdsE</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid433\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid434\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid435\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid436\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Barnsley Badger C64</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid437\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"http://www.psytronik.net/newsite/index.php/c64/74-barnsley\">http://www.psytronik.net/newsite/index.php/c64/74-barnsley</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid438\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid441\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">jsidplay</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid442\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">emulator &amp; sidplayer</span></div>\n<div id=\"m